\ Public file output for a specific calculation day and target day.
\ The default To run is the short regression suite, not a full date.
\ A caller may explicitly use this routine with native-safe day pairs.
\ On success write the five-part English date. On failure write an
\ explanatory message, never the numeric fields of an older query.
\
\ The output path is the runtime module's absolute directory.
\ A matching CAL compiler has not yet executed this source.

The calendar date report is a string.
The calendar date report path is a path.

To prepare the calendar date report:
  Put "" into the calendar date report.
  If the complete date status is not 1,
    put the complete date error into the calendar date report; exit.
  Render the complete date in English.
  If the complete English date text is blank,
    put "The calculated date could not be given its English names." into the calendar date report; exit.
  Put the complete English date text into the calendar date report.

To write calendar date output for a calendar day and another calendar day:
  Calculate complete date values given the calendar day and the other calendar day.
  Prepare the calendar date report.
  Put the calendar date report into a buffer.
  Put the module's directory then "pastafarian-date.txt" into the calendar date report path.
  Write the buffer to the calendar date report path.
